# Nauss instances solved without an initial upper bound, with the diving heuristic of Pessoa et al. (2020) at the root
# (option -d: DivingHeurUseDepthLimit = 0, MaxLDSdepth = 3, MaxLDSbreadth = 2). See NAUSS_BENCHMARK.md.
# Tip: after a batch execution, call 'grep statistics: out/nauss-diving.out -h | cut -c13-' to get the results as rows for a LaTeX table.
